   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "The Antares 8 has all you need for cruising down the coast in perfect comfort: a galley area with a fridge and a gas or electric hob. The boat can also be fitted with an air-conditioning system.\nThe boat has two double berths, one in the cabin and other in the wheelhouse, and can sleep up to five passengers. An extra berth can also be set up in the space under the saloon area.",
